    "description": "Nestled on a quiet street, just steps to Lands End Trail and the Golden Gate National Recreation Area, 175-177 Seal Rock Drive is an exceptionally charming, bright, mid-century, 2-unit building in move-in condition.  Meticulously maintained and updated by the same family for decades, this property captures the California coastal lifestyle with ocean views, nearby hiking trails, a short stroll to Ocean Beach and stunning sunsets.    Both units provide 2 large bedrooms with southern views to the Ocean offering a great way to start your mornings.  Each unit has 1 full bathroom with shower and tub, a modern kitchen, dining room, and living room with peekaboo views of the ocean through the trees at Lands End. The property is complete with a quiet, landscaped garden adjacent to a 2-car, side-by-side garage with plenty of storage.    Close to Nature, Seal Rock Drive offers a friendly neighborhood who love the outdoors."
  },
